{"text":{"en":{"축하중용 구름 볼 베어링 (인서트 베어링) | [회사명] 베어링":"Radial Insert Ball Bearings | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Radial Insert Ball Bearings</p> <h2>축하중용 구름 볼 베어링 (인서트 베어링)</h2> <p>베어링 유닛의 하우징 없이 내륜만 축에 고정하는 인서트 베어링입니다.</p> <p>세트 스크류(그럽 스크류)형(AY/GYE/GAY)과 편심 로킹 칼라형(GRAE/RAE/GE)으로 나뉩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Radial Insert Ball Bearings</p> <h2>Radial Insert Ball Bearings</h2> <p>These are insert bearings in which only the inner ring is fixed to the shaft, without the housing of a bearing unit.</p> <p>Divided into set-screw (grub screw) type (AY/GYE/GAY) and eccentric locking collar type (GRAE/RAE/GE).</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just the model number or part of the dimensions.</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/radial_insert.png\" alt=\"구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경) · D(외경) · 공차(d/D) · C · B</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Our SWS catalog specification drawing</p> <img src=\"img/radial_insert.png\" alt=\"Structural cross-section diagram\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(bore) · D(outer diameter) · Tolerance (d/D) · C · B</p>","<label for=\"ribFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"ribFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: GYE20-NPP-B 또는 20*47\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"ribFilter\">Model / Spec Search</label> <input id=\"ribFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. GYE20-NPP-B or 20*47\" autocomplete=\"off\">","<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"ribCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"ribToggleAll\">전체 펼치기</butto